plicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKUDA MASAKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUDA, MASAKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An ink-jet printer head performs constantly stable high-speed operation to make a high-quality printout independently of ambient temperature.  A nozzle (7), an ink supply hole (6) and a pressure chamber (2) are designed to have inertance mT and acoustic resistance rT (at about 20 DEG C) that satisfy the following expressions with ink full: (1) 0 &lt; mT &lt; 1.9 x 10&lt;8&gt; [kg/m&lt;4&gt;] ...; (2) 4.0 x 10&lt;12&gt; &lt; rT &lt; 11.0 x 10&lt;12&gt; [Ns/m&lt;5&gt;] ...</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Une tête d'imprimante à jet d'encre exécute une opération rapide et stable de façon constante pour produire une impression de haute qualité indépendamment de la température ambiante. Une buse (7), un trou (6) d'alimentation en encre et une chambre (2) de pression sont conçus pour avoir une inertance mT et une résistance acoustique rT (à environ 20 DEG C) satisfaisant les expressions suivantes avec le plein d'encre: (1) 0 &lt; mT &lt; 1,9 x 10&lt;8&gt; [kg/m&lt;4&gt;] ...; (2) 4,0 x 10&lt;12&gt; &lt; rT &lt; 11,0 x 10&lt;12&gt; [Ns/m&lt;5&gt;] ...</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>